{"id":"potom","lemma":"потом","pos":"adv","rank":115,"glosses":["afterwards, afterward, after that","then","later"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c2/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Можно я это потом сделаю?","en":"Can I do this later?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/219210","words":[{"g":"one can, one may"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"}]},{"text":"Что случилось потом?","en":"What happened afterwards?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to happen","l":"случиться"},null]},{"text":"Что ты делал потом?","en":"What did you do after that?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},null]},{"text":"Скажите мне, куда идти потом.","en":"Tell me where to go next.","words":[{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"where?"},{"g":"to go"},null]},{"text":"Я тебе потом скажу.","en":"I'll tell you later.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"}]}]}